    <string name="ways_row_left">Left on %1$s, %2$s</string>
    <string name="ways_footer">Distances are estimates, from your steps and your step length: measuring your step makes them truer. A day counts as Passo recorded it, so History, Insights and your way always agree.</string>
    <string name="ways_credit">Ways drawn from OpenStreetMap, © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Land and water: Natural Earth.</string>

